          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram mi wä juray wä cam kiɛ mäth kɛ liɛɛr Kua̱r ni Yecu kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p mi /ci gɔaa bɛ duer kɛ yäri pua̱ny kɛnɛ riɛm Kua̱r ni Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A raan caar rɔɔdɛ kɛ nhiam, bɛ kulɛ juray cam kä bɛ maath kɛ liɛɛr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ram mi mi̱th kä mäth a /kenɛ puɔ̱ny Yecu kɔŋ ŋa̱c, camkɛ kä ma̱thkɛ ni rɔ̱ luk Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn ɛn ni̱n kɔ̱c kɛ yɛ, kä te nɛy ti ŋuan kɛ jua̱th, kä ci tha̱a̱ŋkun li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi luɔ̱knɛ rɔ̱, /ca kɔn bi luk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi luɔ̱kɛ kɔn ɛ Kuäär ni Yecu, ca kɔn tɔ̱ŋ kɛ kui̱ kä ɣöö /ca kɔn bi kuɛth kɛɛl kɛ ɣɔw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ, dämaari, mi cia rɔ̱ dol guäth kɛl kɛ ɣöö bia mi̱eth Kua̱r ni Yecu cam, liɛpɛ rɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi na̱kɛ raan ɛ buɔth a jɛ mi̱th cieŋ, kɛ ɣöö /ca yɛ bi luk mi wiaa wä mat kɛɛl. Kɛ kui̱ ŋɔaani tin kɔ̱kiɛn bäkɛ ben la̱t yɛ mi wa̱a̱ wä ben.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
